{
  "key": 1030,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PleaseEnjoyYourself",
      "en_US": "Please enjoy yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ShouldBeGratefulForLongLife",
      "en_US": [
        "I should be grateful for my long\n",
        "life.\r",
        "Never did I think I would get to\n",
        "see the bones of a dragon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WantYouToGetAmberExamined",
      "en_US": [
        "Ssh! Listen, I need to share a\n",
        "secret with someone.\r",
        "I think that this chunk of Amber\n",
        "contains Pokémon Dna!\r",
        "It would be a shattering scientific\n",
        "breakthrough if Pokémon could be\f",
        "resurrected from it.\r",
        "But, my colleagues just ignore\n",
        "what I have to say.\r",
        "So, I have a favor to ask!\r",
        "I want you to get this examined at\n",
        "a Pokémon Lab somewhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ReceivedOldAmberFromMan",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received the Old Amber\n",
        "from the man."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BeautifulPieceOfAmber",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a beautiful piece of\n",
        "Amber in a clear gold color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WeHaveTwoFossilsOnExhibit",
      "en_US": [
        "We have two fossils of rare,\n",
        "prehistoric Pokémon on exhibit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_SeismicTossTutor_Retired",
      "en_US": [
        "I used to teach Seismic\n",
        "Toss. The Leader Academy’s\r",
        "masters teach it now. Look\n",
        "for the Fighting master in\r",
        "Saffron City."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AerodactylFossil",
      "en_US": [
        "Aerodactyl Fossil\n",
        "A primitive and rare Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_KabutopsFossil",
      "en_US": [
        "Kabutops Fossil\n",
        "A primitive and rare Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureBrock",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Journal\r",
        "Special Feature: Pewter Gym\n",
        "Leader Brock!\r",
        "Brock rarely laughs, but is said to\n",
        "be unable to stop if he starts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DoYouKnowWhatAmberIs",
      "en_US": [
        "You can’t sneak in the back way!\n",
        "Nice try, kid, but no.\r",
        "Oh, whatever!\n",
        "Do you know what Amber is?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_GetOldAmberChecked",
      "en_US": [
        "Ssh!\n",
        "Get the Old Amber checked!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveSpaceForThis",
      "en_US": "You don’t have space for this."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Its50YForChildsTicket",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes, yes.\n",
        "It’s ¥50 for a child’s ticket.\r",
        "Would you like to come in?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ComeAgain",
      "en_US": "Come again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberContainsGeneticMatter",
      "en_US": [
        "Amber contains the genetic matter\n",
        "of ancient Pokémon.\r",
        "There’s a Lab somewhere trying to\n",
        "resurrect Pokémon from Amber."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberIsFossilizedSap",
      "en_US": [
        "Amber is actually sap, that gooey\n",
        "stuff that oozes from trees.\r",
        "The ancient sap fossilized over\n",
        "time to become rock-hard Amber."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Right50YThankYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Right, ¥50!\n",
        "Thank you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveEnoughMoney",
      "en_US": "You don’t have enough money."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0464_T03R0101_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
